03:36.950 --> 03:38.150
Siwei.

03:38.150 --> 03:39.670
Kakakmu sudah pulang.

03:40.360 --> 03:41.400
Kakak.

03:45.350 --> 03:46.130
Kak.

03:48.030 --> 03:48.550
Makan permen.

03:50.530 --> 03:52.260
Tadi aku jilat sekali.

03:52.910 --> 03:54.100
Ge Siwei.

03:55.030 --> 03:56.350
Kamu menjijikkan sekali.

03:56.350 --> 03:57.120
